o other Players!\n\nRare Collectibles Spawning on the islands can be picked up and used in insane combos that give you OP boosts.\n\nJoin our Community Server for Updates!\n\nThis game is in ALPHA! We may mess up sometimes, but we'll try our best to make the best game possible!","path":"/game/17601705136-tycoon-rng","slug":"17601705136-tycoon-rng","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c1e785001491ca1c0ca0d9924b1ba85aea357ef7662bd4e6cb51fb76a0e938b2.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-86b08d56d32c64abac194d4d04bcf53b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":12,"visitor":40770733,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-15T16:53:57.087Z","creator":{"name":"Tycoon RNG 99","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":17,"freeCount":17,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":75203399886990,"name":"Mafia Clash","desc":"🔪Your family is at WAR! Four rival families are competing for control of your city's underworld. Whose side will you take? Will you be a simple grunt, rise through the ranks to become the boss, or fight them as a cop? 🔪\n\n⭐ CLAIM your COMMUNITY MEMBER role by joining the group: https://www.roblox.com/groups/35589408\n\n- 💰 Become the Boss and command real players to glory!\n- 🧑‍🏭 Climb the ranks of your family with over 11 unique classes!\n- ❤️ Steal and survive in a massive open world! \n- 👍 Enjoy the game? Leave a favorite and like to support the developers!\n\n💬Check out the Social Links below to learn more about our community!\n\n🏷️1930’s, Tommy gun, Shooter, Jail, Cops, Police, Heist, Robbery","path":"/game/75203399886990-mafia-clash","slug":"75203399886990-mafia-clash","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d22ea00c833fe400cb3a0d380594937da94ad56bf7e10680e3368a9f5845ea23.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-30db657ecd7c7d218401566ebdf154a5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":12,"visitor":3016555,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-02T13:18:18.263Z","creator":{"name":"Mafia Clash Community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"free